, then selling whatever valuables they find. Both are devastated when they learn that Kichi has died, but his wife soon begins an affair with a neighbor who survived the war, Hachi. The mother disapproves and, when she can't steal Hachi for herself, tries to scare her daughter-in-law with a mysterious mask from a dead samurai."}],"https://schema.org/datePublished":[{"@value":"1964-11-21T00:00:00.000Z","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"}],"https://schema.org/image":[{"@id":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyPLG53OodhJtvfQEfcmC43l16O.jpg"}],"https://schema.org/sameAs":[{"@id":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/3763"}]},{"@id":"solid://movies/onibaba-1964#it-metadata","@type":["https://vocab.noeldemartin.com/crdt/Metadata"],"https://vocab.noeldemartin.com/crdt/createdAt":[{"@value":"2026-08-25T09:44:04.411Z","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"}],"https://vocab.noeldemartin.com/crdt/updatedAt":[{"@value":"2026-08-25T09:44:04.411Z","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"}],"https://vocab.noeldemartin.com/crdt/resource":[{"@id":"solid://movies/onibaba-1964#it"}]}]},{"@graph":[{"@id":"solid://movies/invalid-poster#it","@type":["https://schema.org/Movie"],"https://schema.org/name":[{"@value":"Invalid Poster"}],"https://schema.org/image":[{"@id":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/invalid.jpg"}]}]},{"@graph":[{"@id":"solid://movies/the-testament-of-dr-mabuse-1933#it","@type":["https://schema.org/Movie"],"https://schema.org/name":[{"@value":"The Testament of Dr. Mabuse"}],"https://schema.org/description":[{"@value":"After a detective is assaulted by thugs and placed in an asylum run by Professor Baum, he observes the professor's preoccupation with another patient, the criminal genius Dr. Mabuse the hypnotist. When Mabuse's notes are found to be connected with a rash of recent crimes, Commissioner Lohmann must determine how Mabuse is communicating with the criminals, despite conflicting reports on the doctor's whereabouts, and capture him for good."}],"https://schema.org/datePublished":[{"@value":"1933-04-21T00:00:00.000Z","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"}],"https://schema.org/image":[{"@id":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tc2ET7j6X066VCjdHblSwLr8sEz.jpg"}],"https://schema.org/sameAs":[{"@id":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/12206"}]},{"@id":"solid://movies/the-testament-of-dr-mabuse-1933#it-metadata","@type":["https://vocab.noeldemartin.com/crdt/Metadata"],"https://vocab.noeldemartin.com/crdt/createdAt":[{"@value":"2026-08-25T09:44:56.205Z","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"}],"https://vocab.noeldemartin.com/crdt/updatedAt":[{"@value":"2026-08-25T09:44:56.205Z","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"}],"https://vocab.noeldemartin.com/crdt/resource":[{"@id":"solid://movies/the-testament-of-dr-mabuse-1933#it"}]}]}]
